---
author: Southside COC
published: 2025-06-02
rating: 5
---
Working with Brink Design was a fantastic experience. They helped us turn a basic livestream setup into a reliable, professional system. Our video and audio quality improved instantly, and the ability to share sermon slides both in-person and online has made a big impact. We appreciated how they repurposed some of our existing equipment to keep costs down while still delivering a high-end result. Setup is easier, the stream looks better, and everything just works. We’re very thankful for their work and highly recommend them to other churches.
